WEBVTT

1
00:01:22.508 --> 00:01:23.508
song It is time for lunch.

2
00:01:25.069 --> 00:01:29.631
Green: I have cheese.

3
00:01:31.352 --> 00:01:32.512
And I have chips.

4
00:01:34.253 --> 00:01:37.294
Pink: I want fish!

5
00:01:38.055 --> 00:01:42.096
Green: We can catch fish.

6
00:01:44.317 --> 00:01:50.420
The pals go to the They get poles.

7
00:01:54.272 --> 00:01:55.433
They go to the lake.

8
00:02:04.942 --> 00:02:06.863
Blue, what did you catch?

9
00:02:08.185 --> 00:02:11.768
Blue: It is a brush.

10
00:02:13.489 --> 00:02:17.933
Yellow: Where are the fish?

11
00:02:26.556 --> 00:02:28.197
Red: There are no fish!

12
00:02:29.857 --> 00:02:31.978
Pink: Look!

13
00:02:32.699 --> 00:02:34.179
Let's ask the sheep.

14
00:02:35.920 --> 00:02:40.422
Red: Did you catch fish?

15
00:02:40.442 --> 00:02:43.583
Sheep: Yes.

16
00:02:44.944 --> 00:02:47.325
But I want cheese and chips.

17
00:02:48.805 --> 00:02:51.347
Pink: We have cheese and chips.

18
00:02:52.787 --> 00:02:53.928
Can we have a fish?

19
00:02:56.476 --> 00:02:58.357
Sheep: Yes.

20
00:02:58.537 --> 00:02:59.717
Here you go!
